docs {
  # Create Accommodation - Park Hyatt Tokyo

  Creates a whole-day accommodation entry for Park Hyatt Tokyo.

  **Accommodation Type**: `whole_day` - Staying entire day with no check-in/out activity

  **Fields**:
  - `trip_day_id`: ID of the trip day (replace with actual ID)
  - `accommodation_type`: Can be `check_in`, `whole_day`, or `check_out`
  - `check_in_time`/`check_out_time`: Unix timestamps
  - `name`: Hotel/accommodation name
  - `address`: Full address
  - `latitude`/`longitude`: GPS coordinates
  - `confirmation_number`: Booking confirmation
  - `cost`: Per night cost
  - `currency`: ISO currency code (USD, JPY, etc.)
  - `display_order`: Order for multiple accommodations per day
}
